  "prefLabel": "En 807.06 Department Action",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 807.06 Department Action.\n\n(a) The department shall act upon staff's recommendation unless the respondent requests a hearing pursuant to En 807.05(b).\n\n(b) Upon receipt of a hearing request under En 807.05(b), the department shall provide the respondent with notice and an opportunity for a hearing, held pursuant to En 200.\n\n(c) At any hearing held under (b) above, the respondent shall have an opportunity to present evidence disputing the department's determination.\n\nSource. #14062, eff 8-21-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en800.html"
